{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Idle Isle 是一款極簡風格的專注計時工具，透過倒數計時與精選背景音樂，協助使用者在讀書、工作、休息及冥想時保持專注。介面設計簡潔，減少不必要的干擾，適合學生、上班族以及需要靜心練習的人。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>極簡專注計時與背景音樂</h2>\n<p>Idle Isle 可自訂倒數時間，並提供 5 分鐘、25 分鐘、45 分鐘等快速預設，配合學習、休息與冥想等場景使用，計時結束時以溫和提示提醒。內建白噪音、自然聲與 lo-fi 音樂，支援循環播放及音量調整。所有資料只儲存於本機，無需註冊，亦無廣告。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-112-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-113-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-114-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-115-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-116-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-8-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Idle Isle: Focus &amp; Relax</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T15:57:58.576157+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":331,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}